{"title":"Specimen Cyprus Seniors Provincial/2nd grade/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Specimen_Cyprus_Seniors_Provincial/2nd_grade/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/b/83bd427028ea55d478361eafd719d96ed49a0288.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\alpha=\\sin x_{1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"77\" height=\"14\" />,<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/6/df60bb174686e502144e5dcea2ef53d252a83bc1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\beta=\\cos x_{1}\\sin x_{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"125\" height=\"16\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/8/448e64dfa16f44c4c65c3c625b2333919abd15dc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\gamma=\\cos x_{1}\\cos x_{2} \\sin x_{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"173\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/8/4b87f083409f2ea0165e98c49730f863d5fe55d4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\delta=\\cos x_{1}\\cos x_{2}\\cos x_{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"173\" height=\"15\" /> prove that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/1/791ffc7eef9b76c9cbe83346ab0fb909d5926e52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\alpha^2+\\beta^2+\\gamma^2+\\delta^2=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"171\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Specimen_Cyprus_Seniors_Provincial/2nd_grade/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Plug in the expressions for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/f/10f32377ac67d94f764f12a15ea987e88c85d3e1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\alpha$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/b/fdb63b9e51abe6bbb16acfb5d7b773ddbb5bf4a8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\beta$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"10\" height=\"16\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/9/66981fa3920210c6ad8dbe5e968783d5dd7520c3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\gamma$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"10\" height=\"11\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/4/0a42a8b725c200085e5253db2d2fbf8dab898a8f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\delta$\" width=\"8\" height=\"13\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/d/c3db36b9add7a8436cd0ddc10a6db15f199445a3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\alpha^2+\\beta^2+\\gamma^2+\\delta^2=$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"157\" height=\"18\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/e/a6ecf18c185ca5c5ef0b324c9f73c1f27e23abcc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sin^2x_1 + \\cos^2x_{1}\\sin^2x_{2} + \\cos^2x_{1}\\cos^2x_{2} \\sin^2x_{3} + \\cos^2x_{1}\\cos^2x_{2} \\cos^2x_{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"552\" height=\"20\" /> \n</p><p><br />\nFactor the last two terms: \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/d/c3db36b9add7a8436cd0ddc10a6db15f199445a3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\alpha^2+\\beta^2+\\gamma^2+\\delta^2=$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"157\" height=\"18\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/2/502f2f1f85a476bb7824622ef8f56f41a392ced7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sin^2x_1 + \\cos^2x_{1}\\sin^2x_{2} + (\\cos^2x_{1}\\cos^2x_{2})(\\sin^2x_{3}+\\cos^2x_{3})$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"462\" height=\"20\" /> \n</p><p><br />\nUse the identity <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/2/27296590eb2812f5ebb1aa6f05e5d5299c6fea68.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\cos^2x + \\sin^2x = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"143\" height=\"17\" />: \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/d/c3db36b9add7a8436cd0ddc10a6db15f199445a3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\alpha^2+\\beta^2+\\gamma^2+\\delta^2=$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"157\" height=\"18\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/7/cc793649543aa43ffa4ef1538fab5b31b56fb918.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sin^2x_1 + \\cos^2x_{1}\\sin^2x_{2} + \\cos^2x_{1}\\cos^2x_{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"308\" height=\"18\" /> \n</p><p><br />\nFactor the last two terms: \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/d/c3db36b9add7a8436cd0ddc10a6db15f199445a3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\alpha^2+\\beta^2+\\gamma^2+\\delta^2=$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"157\" height=\"18\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/d/02dbc32759c33fd80b75b02bb8c1547e73addde9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sin^2x_1 + (\\cos^2x_{1})(\\sin^2x_{2}+\\cos^2x_{2})$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"278\" height=\"20\" /> \n</p><p><br />\nUse the identity <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/2/27296590eb2812f5ebb1aa6f05e5d5299c6fea68.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\cos^2x + \\sin^2x = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"143\" height=\"17\" />: \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/d/c3db36b9add7a8436cd0ddc10a6db15f199445a3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\alpha^2+\\beta^2+\\gamma^2+\\delta^2=$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"157\" height=\"18\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/2/b92ebda1ace9c289ef5ceb78d7934480d99fe710.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sin^2x_1 + \\cos^2x_{1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"123\" height=\"18\" /> \n</p><p><br />\nUse the identity <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/2/27296590eb2812f5ebb1aa6f05e5d5299c6fea68.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\cos^2x + \\sin^2x = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"143\" height=\"17\" />: \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/d/c3db36b9add7a8436cd0ddc10a6db15f199445a3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\alpha^2+\\beta^2+\\gamma^2+\\delta^2=$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"157\" height=\"18\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/1/0017f07cc1b486d9804d1e8541f18dc7041f8d7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\mathbb{Q.E.D}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -8px\" width=\"60\" height=\"26\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<hr />\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Specimen_Cyprus_Seniors_Provincial/2nd_grade/Problem_1\" title=\"Specimen Cyprus Seniors Provincial/2nd grade/Problem 1\">Previous Problem</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Specimen_Cyprus_Seniors_Provincial/2nd_grade/Problem_3\" title=\"Specimen Cyprus Seniors Provincial/2nd grade/Problem 3\">Next Problem</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Specimen_Cyprus_Seniors_Provincial/2nd_grade\" title=\"Specimen Cyprus Seniors Provincial/2nd grade\">Back to Exam</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Specimen_Cyprus_Seniors_Provincial/2nd_grade/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Cyprus_Seniors_Provincial_competition\" title=\"Cyprus Seniors Provincial competition\">Cyprus Seniors Provincial competition</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Cyprus_Seniors_Provincial_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"Cyprus Seniors Provincial Problems and Solutions\">Cyprus Seniors Provincial Problems and Solutions</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/in